  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武裝</a> 新增以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火之龍</a> 為主題的武器與特性。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>基於 cbkovak 為 1.12.2 版本開發的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-and-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達與火焰</a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31541291/167636045-658a77d5-6af9-4af8-a819-03fd8ed41d5c.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"450\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支援的材料：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>火龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">對冰龍傷害加成 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 對冰龍造成 +8.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">燃燒 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 使敵人陷入燃燒並將其擊退</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>冰龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">對火龍傷害加成 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 對火龍造成 +8.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">冰凍 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 將敵人凍結 10 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>雷龍骨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">對冰龍傷害加成 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 對冰龍造成 +4.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">對火龍傷害加成 I</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 對火龍造成 +4.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">觸電</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 用閃電攻擊敵人</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沙漠蟻后外骨骼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>對非節肢動物傷害加成</strong></span> - 對非節肢動物和死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沙漠蟻后毒刺</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>對非節肢動物傷害加成</strong></span> - 對非節肢動物和死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">中毒</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 使敵人中毒 10 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>叢林蟻后外骨骼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>對非節肢動物傷害加成</strong></span> - 對非節肢動物和死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>叢林蟻后毒刺</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">對非節肢動物傷害加成</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 對非節肢動物和死亡蠕蟲造成 +4.0 點額外傷害</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">中毒</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 使敵人中毒 10 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>火龍鋼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">燃燒 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 使敵人陷入燃燒並將其擊退</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>冰龍鋼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\">冰凍 II</span>&nbsp;</strong>- 將敵人凍結 15 秒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>雷龍鋼</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>觸電&nbsp;</strong></span>- 用閃電攻擊敵人</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>計畫中的更新：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將較新的功能移植回 1.16.5 版本</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">移植回 1.12.2 版本以支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-rotn-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火之龍：神域版</a> 的雷系武器，並修正沿途出現的任何錯誤</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&height=80&n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
